  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS-10253 GEF SGP 8th Operational Phase (Part 1) Thailand</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Small Grants Programme (SGP) is a corporate programme of the Global Environment Facility (GEF), implemented by UNDP on behalf of the GEF partnership. It supports community-level projects that conserve the environment while improving local livelihoods. In Thailand, SGP empowers civil society and community-based organisations (CSOs/CBOs) to deliver locally led solutions for biodiversity conservation, climate change mitigation and adaptation, and sustainable livelihoods.</narrative>
  </description>
